{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>現場，李彥宏和AI對戰麻將，隨後又體驗了Arvipace運動健康Personal Agent。這套智能Agent主打運動陪伴，slogan為「你只管專注訓練，訓練目標、安排、執行都交給它」，可以輔助用户擼鐵訓練，全程氛圍輕鬆。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/finance/transform/483/w550h733/20261111/75f0-7ddf0a8f8bac2303a970567bffa5a6fe.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>據了解，李彥宏將出席明日召開的百度世界大會，對外分享百度最新技術迭代、大模型產品與業務進展，向外介紹百度AI落地的新方向。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/finance/transform/729/w550h979/20261111/697d-dc29552f536b397b3683a3d966cc57c2.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/finance/transform/483/w550h733/20261111/75f0-7ddf0a8f8bac2303a970567bffa5a6fe.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T10:56:46.165298+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":3,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T10:14:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T02:17:13.068620+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T10:50:08.072884+00:00","content_hash":"73f00243819c3a55f41b8c6aebf47e9656487cff1384bc38ed4e750902cba445","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T10:56:46.165298+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}